# Blocks Speakeasy from regenerating no-op internal/stateupgraders/<entity>_v0.go
# stubs; the real logic lives in internal/stateupgraders/workspace_upgraders.go.
# List files explicitly (no globs) - a glob would also stop Speakeasy from ever
# wiring up a brand-new entity. Per new entity: annotate + regenerate, add its
# exact filename here, add its wrapper in workspace_upgraders.go, rebuild.
